{
  "$id": "https://github.com/Apra-Labs/apra-fleet/blob/main/memory-contract/v1/bindings/mcp/kb_promote.json#",
  "name": "kb_promote",
  "description": "Upgrade KB entry confidence: UNVERIFIED -> INFERRED -> CONFIRMED. Appends promotion note to content as evidence trail. CONFIRMED entries are no-op. In a MEMBER session only entries tagged member:<caller uuid> can be promoted; any other id returns not-found and changes nothing. Scope: always the calling session's own KB -- a member session uses its registered work folder, any other session the fleet server's working folder; there is no repo/path scope argument. Fails with E-SELF-NO-WORKFOLDER, E-SELF-NOT-A-REPO or E-SELF-NO-REMOTE (each with a one-line remediation) when that folder cannot carry a KB identity (it must be a git repository with an origin remote).",
